Deposit & Withdrawal Information

Secure Transactions

On the Way aims to provide a secure and transparent experience for users. Deposit and withdrawal requests are processed through the payment methods and procedures made available on the platform.

Deposit

Users may deposit funds through the payment options available on the platform. Before making a payment, users should review the applicable transaction details, charges, and terms.

Withdrawal

Withdrawal requests are subject to account verification, applicable platform terms, and the payment provider's processing requirements. Processing times may vary depending on the payment method.

GST & Charges

Any GST, transaction charge, service fee, or other applicable amount will be disclosed to the user where required before the relevant transaction. The applicable amount should not be represented as a fixed fee unless it has been officially determined.

Important Notice

No platform can guarantee absolute security or a guaranteed financial return. Users should review the applicable terms, fees, risks, and regulatory requirements before depositing or investing money.

Support

For questions regarding deposits, withdrawals, payments, or account-related issues, please contact On the Way Support through the official Contact section.

On the Way — Transparent. Secure. Responsible.
